        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>本地人排队都要吃重庆美食</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\\\(', '\\\\)']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$'], ['\\\\[', '\\\\]']] } };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      width: 540px;\n      min-height: 720px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background: #fff;\n      color: #53515a;\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Noto Sans CJK SC\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    }\n    .page {\n      width: 540px;\n      height: 720px;\n      padding: 12px 27px 8px 39px;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n    h1 {\n      margin: 0 0 22px 0;\n      text-align: center;\n      color: #333139;\n      font-size: 25px;\n      line-height: 1;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      letter-spacing: .2px;\n    }\n    .item {\n      position: relative;\n      margin: 0 0 17px 0;\n      min-height: 57px;\n    }\n    .tick {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: -20px;\n      top: -4px;\n      color: #ff4db5;\n      font-family: cursive;\n      font-size: 27px;\n      font-weight: 400;\n      transform: rotate(-10deg);\n      line-height: 1;\n    }\n    .line-title {\n      height: 18px;\n      line-height: 18px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n    .name {\n      display: inline-block;\n      padding: 0 2px;\n      color: #507a08;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(transparent 29%, rgba(216,255,68,.84) 29%, rgba(216,255,68,.84) 88%, transparent 88%);\n    }\n    .stars {\n      display: inline-block;\n      margin-left: 6px;\n      color: #fa41b4;\n      font-family: \"Comic Sans MS\", cursive;\n      font-size: 19px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      letter-spacing: -1px;\n      vertical-align: -2px;\n      transform: rotate(-5deg);\n    }\n    p {\n      margin: 2px 0 0 0;\n      color: #575660;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      line-height: 19px;\n      letter-spacing: -.15px;\n    }\n    .pinknote {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 29px;\n      right: 73px;\n      color: #fa46b6;\n      font-family: cursive;\n      font-size: 22px;\n      transform: rotate(-8deg);\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .wave {\n      text-decoration-line: underline;\n      text-decoration-style: wavy;\n      text-decoration-color: #ff4eb7;\n      text-decoration-thickness: 1px;\n      text-underline-offset: 3px;\n    }\n    .i1 { margin-bottom: 17px; }\n    .i2 { margin-bottom: 18px; }\n    .i3 { margin-bottom: 18px; }\n    .i4 { margin-bottom: 17px; }\n    .i5 { margin-bottom: 17px; }\n    .i6 { margin-bottom: 17px; }\n    .i7 { margin-bottom: 17px; }\n    .i8 { margin-bottom: 18px; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <h1>本地人排队都要吃重庆美食</h1>\n\n    <section class=\"item i1\">\n      <span class=\"tick\">✓</span>\n      <div class=\"line-title\">\n        <span class=\"name\">马房湾66号江湖菜</span><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p>非常出名的重庆江湖菜，味道超级地道，推荐江湖第一蒸，辣子鸡，招牌血旺等，环境是七<br>八十年代怀旧风，集颜值与味道于一身的江湖菜</p>\n      <span class=\"pinknote\">重庆江湖菜 top1</span>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"item i2\">\n      <span class=\"tick\">✓</span>\n      <div class=\"line-title\">\n        <span class=\"name\">洋马儿火锅</span><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p>一家藏得很深的火锅，很正宗的九宫格火锅，九宫格上面放着鹌鹑蛋，虾滑、毛肚超级好吃</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"item i3\">\n      <span class=\"tick\">✓</span>\n      <div class=\"line-title\">\n        <span class=\"name\">君之薇火锅</span><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p>这是一家藏在半山腰上的火锅店已经有20多年历史了，味道还是那么霸道，重点是还便宜，<br>性价比超高，冰汤圆和卤味系列的菜是我的最爱，他们家包子还超好吃</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"item i4\">\n      <span class=\"tick\">✓</span>\n      <div class=\"line-title\">\n        <span class=\"name\">六指烧烤</span><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p>烧烤店也能排队排到心累，碳火烤出来的烧烤真的太香了，特别喜欢吃烤豆干，里面放一些<br>他们家的泡萝卜，好吃到哭</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"item i5\">\n      <span class=\"tick\">✓</span>\n      <div class=\"line-title\">\n        <span class=\"name\">沈姐烤鱼</span><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p>很正宗的重庆万州烤鱼，就在重庆大学B区，烤鱼有多种味道，最爱吃的还是香辣味，性<br>价比很高，一大条鱼才几十块钱的样子</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"item i6\">\n      <span class=\"tick\">✓</span>\n      <div class=\"line-title\">\n        <span class=\"name\">熨斗糕老烧饼</span><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p>在较场口的梯坎上，在繁华的大都市中，买上一只只卖5毛钱的熨斗糕满满的童年回忆，Q<br>弹软糯，烧饼也很好吃，价格也很感人！</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"item i7\">\n      <span class=\"tick\">✓</span>\n      <div class=\"line-title\">\n        <span class=\"name\">翠江楼三鲜砂锅米线</span><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p>虽然比较远，但是贵的是程度一般，到这里安静，淳朴！藏在大山上25年的砂锅米线；<br>一排队也可同时煮很多砂锅，每一位料都非常丰富，鲜香四溢！</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"item i8\">\n      <span class=\"tick\">✓</span>\n      <div class=\"line-title\">\n        <span class=\"name\">食济楼重庆特产严选超市</span><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p>重庆买特产的好去处，是连锁店，正规不会被坑，他们家的<span class=\"wave\">上下城火锅底料</span>还不错，作为本<br>地人都经常买来煮火锅</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"item\">\n      <span class=\"tick\">✓</span>\n      <div class=\"line-title\">\n        <span class=\"name\">老院子肥肠鸡</span><span class=\"stars\">★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p>这家店在老居民楼的坝坝里，每天人都是爆满，他们家的肥肠鸡非常入味，滴着油的肥肠柔<br>初又有弹性，口感很不错</p>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>",
